  "text": "And clear design keeps paying off as you grow. Cram the whole store into one wide table, and every rule gets tangled together. Kept apart and joined by keys, each table grows by its own rules. A muddled model is hard to rescue later. A clear one is EASY to improve. And none of this was obvious, once. It started with one paper, in nineteen seventy.",
